{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"低音和弦的重压从226小节开始，一直推动到241小节。\",\"source\":\"左手涌起滚滚低音波涛，右手的和弦像重锤一样砸下。每次爆发之后，紧张都没有完全解除，反而又形成新的压力。波兰舞曲的步子不是一下子整齐地回来：起头几小节还像在试探前方有没有路，随后步伐一点点聚拢，到最后四小节，前进感越来越不可回避。\",\"type\":\"5\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿分别描述了低音和弦造成的反复压力、舞步逐渐聚拢，没有说前者从226小节持续推动到241小节；屏幕稿新增了这一持续推进的判断。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d41529b9-8432-480c-9813-37e911ee1673", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T091110082263Z", "elapsed_seconds": 263.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T09:15:33.923243+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9b31bf671f7fbf35b1e20de7df7e2ba553c8b51e8488a9d6a90cf29e729fdf9b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_eviden